{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sistema de Inventario Pro - API",
    "description": "Colección de endpoints REST del Sistema de Inventario Pro.\n\n**Variables de entorno necesarias:**\n- `base_url` (ej. `http://127.0.0.1:8000/api`)\n- `email` (usuario para login)\n- `password` (contraseña)\n- `token` (se setea automáticamente tras Login)\n\n**Flujo recomendado:**\n1. Ejecutar `Auth > Login` — guarda automáticamente el token.\n2. El resto de endpoints usan `{{token}}` automáticamente.\n\n**Proveedor:** SI SISTEMAS INFORMATICOS Y TECNOLOGIA SAS — NIT 900.583.147-1",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "superadmin@sitecsas.com" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('Token guardado en variable de colección.');",
                  "  } else if (json.requires_2fa) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('mfa_token', json.mfa_token);",
                  "    console.log('Login requiere 2FA. Usar endpoint Verify 2FA.');",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify 2FA",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.access_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mfa_token\": \"{{mfa_token}}\",\n  \"code\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/2fa/verify"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me (perfil)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/refresh"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2FA - Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/2fa/status"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2FA - Setup init",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/2fa/setup/init"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2FA - Setup verify",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/2fa/setup/verify"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
